!.codeium/windsurf/user_settings.pb

.cursor/*
!.cursor/mcp.json
!.cursor/user_settings.pb

# Claude Code - DEFAULT-DENY. The personal agent brain (CLAUDE.md, client/infra
# skills, kb-*/release agents) lives in the private overlay ~/.dotfiles-private.
# Only generic, shareable assets are allowlisted below — a NEW skill/agent is
# private unless you add it here, so nothing client-specific auto-publishes.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/
.claude/commands/kb/
.claude/commands/remember.md
.claude/commands/wave.md
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
# .mcp.json (personal MCP endpoints) lives in the private overlay.
# Skills: an ALLOWLIST. Everything under .claude/skills is ignored, then the generic
# skills are named back in one at a time; anything client- or infra-specific lives in
# the private overlay instead, and .githooks/pre-commit blocks the tokens that decide
# which is which. Skills are stored as <category>/<name>/, so the un-ignore has to walk
# back down two levels - hence the */ and */* pairs below.
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/SKILL-TEMPLATE.md
!.claude/skills/*/
.claude/skills/*/*
!.claude/skills/authoring/figma-use/
!.claude/skills/authoring/marp-slide/
!.claude/skills/authoring/one-pager/
!.claude/skills/authoring/shell-test-harness/
!.claude/skills/authoring/skill-refine/
!.claude/skills/authoring/svg-diagram/
!.claude/skills/authoring/update-rules/
!.claude/skills/memory/claude-recall/
!.claude/skills/memory/compact-prep/
!.claude/skills/memory/notes-system/
!.claude/skills/memory/project-index/
